Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.36,0:00:21.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin. Wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.32,0:00:29.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come over here.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.47,0:00:35.93,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's only a dream. Don't be scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.71,0:00:43.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Huh?{Sounds better, less like a word, just an expression of confusion}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.05,0:02:42.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here, I'm counting on you.{I don't like this line, can't think of something else}{No probs, looks fine enough. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.68,0:02:50.90,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You helped me like that when we were at Grandpa's place, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.16,0:02:54.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:01.57,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,You know, I want my own kitchen knife. {包丁 houchou = Kitchen knife}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.64,0:03:04.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's a bit too early.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.91,0:03:06.77,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,There are some made just for kids.{A child would never use "children" to refer to their own class.}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.77,0:03:08.04,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.05,0:03:13.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let me think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.29,0:03:17.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,All right, hurry up and finish eating.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.42,0:03:18.90,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,We have to get going soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:36.29,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't the baby cute?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.42,0:03:39.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah. {Added. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.36,0:03:48.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm Kawachi Daikichi, the relative of Kaga Rin's father.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.09,0:03:52.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm currently living together with Rin-san... I mean Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.04,0:04:01.27,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Um, you are Yoshii Masako-san, Rin's mother; am I right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.27,0:04:03.80,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Er, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.80,0:04:07.56,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Uh, me? Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.56,0:04:10.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I want to meet you directly and have a talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.71,0:04:14.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I will go somewhere near where you live; please tell me the place to meet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.81,0:04:16.22,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Meeting place?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.66,0:04:19.24,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,W-Where...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.24,0:04:21.01,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Near the shopping district— {商店街 shoutengai}{"Shopping District" is fine}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.01,0:04:24.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, but I don't even know where you live.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:40.23,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Wow, it's so cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.23,0:04:42.59,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So many of them, you're a pretty good Mom.{Literal TL: "You made them again, Mom." Please use whichever fits. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.59,0:04:44.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This flower too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.18,0:04:47.15,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,That's right. It's called an embroidery.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.15,0:04:50.27,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I see, it's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.27,0:04:54.25,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,When you're a little older, I'll teach you how to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.25,0:04:55.48,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.48,0:04:58.05,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Your hands are very delicate.{intricate makes no sense}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.07,0:05:02.64,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,So how do you intend to handle it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.70,0:05:05.87,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll meet her first and then decide.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.87,0:05:08.71,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll leave Rin to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.71,0:05:09.84,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.84,0:05:10.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.99,0:05:14.79,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,This is very important, so make sure you have a proper talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.79,0:05:17.37,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Your mom can have fun with Rin-chan, in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.88,0:05:30.51,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This place is actually quite close to Grandpa's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.31,0:05:32.57,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.57,0:05:34.26,Default,Girl,0000,0000,0000,,Table for one? {Are you alone}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.26,0:05:36.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,There will be another person coming later.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.05,0:05:37.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No smoking zone.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.36,0:05:39.56,Default-Alt,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Drink slowly, don't choke.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.56,0:05:41.66,Default-Alt,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}It's so stressful.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.66,0:05:43.05,Default-Alt,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Yeah, I understand how it feels.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.05,0:05:44.39,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,American coffee, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.39,0:05:46.76,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Sure! A cup of American coffee.{"Right away" = three syllables for "hai".  "Sure" is one, fits better.}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.48,Default,Waitress,0000,0000,0000,,Will that be all?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.48,0:05:48.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.23,0:05:52.10,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,That's really great, Saionji-sensei.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.32,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,As expected of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.32,0:05:56.90,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Now you just have to put the characters through some traumatic events.{We use "flaws" in discussing negative character traits, not "traumas"}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.90,0:05:58.69,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I-Isn't that too many?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.69,0:06:01.50,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,No, it'll be perfect this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.50,0:06:02.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.79,0:06:05.35,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't find a single clue about her at Grandpa's place at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.35,0:06:07.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,To think that she even lives somewhere so near?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.61,0:06:10.14,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, Sensei, I'm counting on you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.14,0:06:12.59,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Thanks for the hard work.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.59,0:06:15.45,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Such a way of escaping after abandoning a child is just too careless.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.45,0:06:17.05,Default-Alt,Boy,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}Mommy, I want to pee!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.05,0:06:19.35,Default-Alt,Lady,0000,0000,0000,,{\an2}OK, hold it for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.02,0:06:26.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hello, where are you right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.28,0:06:28.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I'm already inside the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:33.12,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.04,0:06:40.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,S-Souichi-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.78,0:06:43.42,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wrong. I'm his grandson.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.41,0:06:53.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She totally looks like a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.14,0:06:57.77,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,U-Um, I'm really sorry. You look really alike.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.77,0:07:01.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, it's fine. I get that a lot from others lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.57,0:07:07.95,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But Souichi-san seems to looked much kinder, or how should I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.75,0:07:12.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I brought a photo of Rin with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.57,0:07:15.10,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.10,0:07:19.66,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This was taken this year, at a rice-cake-pounding event at the daycare. {He does say "daycare" there, please add. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:27.04,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,She really looks like a big sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.80,0:07:37.98,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Someone seemed to have addressed you as sensei earlier on.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.98,0:07:39.78,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Y-You saw it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.78,0:07:41.14,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But the name is...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.14,0:07:42.46,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's for my work. {My pen name/work name/alias}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.46,0:07:45.45,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I was rushing through the scripts last night,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.45,0:07:47.69,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,so I'm a little disorganized now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.49,0:07:55.95,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Was it because of work that you decided to abandon Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.95,0:07:58.12,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.12,0:08:01.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It looks like you made Rin think you were an assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.43,0:08:03.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Has it been that way since she was a baby?{Did this start ever since Rin was very young?}{I completly rewrote this line-AvidElite}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.82,0:08:06.66,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It is, indeed, because of work.{This is a cumsy/shy way of speaking with a little elegance, which it what I get from hearing her.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.66,0:08:11.49,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But it's also true that I was Souichi-san's assistant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.49,0:08:14.96,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I couldn't treat Rin as my own daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.96,0:08:16.61,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I had decided that back when I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.61,0:08:18.96,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,E-Excuse me, I don't understand the meaning of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.96,0:08:20.98,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,My manga are not always well received.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.98,0:08:25.15,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It wasn't easy getting a major job, but then I found out I was pregnant.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.14,0:08:28.77,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, this isn't a job that can be done while looking after a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.77,0:08:31.63,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But Souichi-san still convinced me to give birth{ to it}.{to "her"? -sm}{Nothing at all works just as well.}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.63,0:08:33.82,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,At the time, I was either working or sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.82,0:08:36.07,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I got a little bigger every day.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.07,0:08:42.54,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,And then, it's strange, I even thought Rin looked adorable and cute when she was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.34,0:08:45.54,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It was strange?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.54,0:08:52.97,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Even though I kept saying I was not her mother, I tried really hard to work and take care of her.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.97,0:08:57.31,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But getting up early is still too painful.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.31,0:08:59.58,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes, I even have to meet the editor in the middle of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.58,0:09:03.43,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's physically impossible for me not to sleep in the morning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.58,0:09:14.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I heard that Rin spent some nights at your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.24,0:09:15.02,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes. {Added. -sm}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.02,0:09:17.61,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Did you go out at night even then?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.61,0:09:20.01,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It's more of midnight rather than at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.01,0:09:22.76,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I only went out for a bit after Rin fell asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.76,0:09:25.21,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Sometimes I'd have Souichi-san look after her.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.47,0:09:29.46,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin still wakes up at night, even now.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.24,0:09:34.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,When she wakes up, how will she feel if there isn't anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.32,0:09:35.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Have you ever thought about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:39.23,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,But... then how do you expect me to raise a child by myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.23,0:09:43.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's why Grandpa suggested the three of you live together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.44,0:09:49.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep living with Rin; is that fine with you?{Changed the negation of his sentence so her "hai" on the next line can be subbed as "yes".}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.90,0:09:52.97,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.02,0:09:56.55,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm no longer Rin's mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.55,0:09:59.22,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,So I have no right to decide how she lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.22,0:10:03.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You're still the one who gave birth to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.23,0:10:05.45,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,T-That has nothing to do with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.12,0:10:09.79,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How exactly do you feel about Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.79,0:10:12.09,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Is she important to you or not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.36,0:10:14.65,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I... {\alpha&HFFFF}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.65,0:10:16.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,I... I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.44,0:10:34.14,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.14,0:10:35.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:40.53,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Please allow her to adopt your surname when she starts school.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.53,0:10:42.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What? Surname?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.23,0:10:45.92,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It will leave a bad memory if her surname is different from her guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.92,0:10:48.58,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Can you promise me just this one thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.86,0:10:52.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I understand what you mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.23,0:10:54.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But I can't promise you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.75,0:10:56.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She's always been called Kaga Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:11:00.38,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,How can she change her own name so easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.38,0:11:02.55,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm a woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.55,0:11:05.62,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There's no need to feel a sense of longing, or be stubborn about my surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.62,0:11:08.35,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,It'll have to change eventually.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.15,0:11:12.69,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Rin is a woman too. I'm sure she'll feel the same way.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.69,0:11:16.23,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,No, Rin is only 6 years old.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.23,0:11:18.75,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But that's not the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.75,0:11:21.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is only a one-sided opinion on your part—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.25,0:11:22.82,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,There's only one thing that's important.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.82,0:11:25.72,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That's the name Souichi-san gave her, which is "Rin".
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.72,0:11:27.66,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,That is all there is. Excuse me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.91,0:11:30.49,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, {\alpha&HFFFF}I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.49,0:11:31.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I'm a guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.97,0:11:34.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I don't quite understand those things that you said.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.12,0:11:37.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But, I'll discuss this over with Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:38.74,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Discuss?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.74,0:11:42.18,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you think it's cruel to let such a young child decide—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.18,0:11:43.08,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:47.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I will do what I feel is best for Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.75,0:11:51.84,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Besides, deciding for her is even more cruel.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.84,0:11:56.41,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I will hear how she feels about it, and then we will both decide this together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.32,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I will then inform you of the outcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.89,0:12:14.96,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,She's definitely an imbecile, I'm sure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.96,0:12:17.93,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}In any case, how could she just abandon such a small and adorable child?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.93,0:12:19.53,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}That makes no sense!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.53,0:12:22.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}But she's still concerned about Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's just that she's a pretty eccentric person or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.77,0:12:27.47,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,She doesn't seem to notice how much trouble she's causing others.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.47,0:12:28.80,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What are you saying?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.80,0:12:31.22,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Of course it's natural for a mother to worry about her daughter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.22,0:12:33.28,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,But if she really worries about her, she'll surely want to meet her!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.28,0:12:36.62,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now, maybe she has some sort of difficulty.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.62,0:12:38.12,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.12,0:12:41.75,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Your Grandpa, seriously what did he see in her?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.75,0:12:45.62,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it doesn't matter now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.62,0:12:50.20,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But it's just that she asked me to allow Rin to use my surname when she starts elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.20,0:12:53.16,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, I approve of this as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.16,0:12:54.77,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.77,0:12:58.17,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,It's obviously better for a child to have the same surname as the guardian.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.17,0:13:03.78,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,About that, I understand; but how do I explain it to Rin?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.78,0:13:05.13,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I mean, she has her own surname.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.13,0:13:07.40,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,Oh, she's a girl after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.40,0:13:10.91,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}She will have to change her surname after getting married.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.91,0:13:12.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}This again!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.24,0:13:13.74,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What are you making a fuss about?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.74,0:13:16.74,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}Compared to letting others gossip about her surname which will hurt her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.74,0:13:19.45,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}isn't it better for her to use our surname at school?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.45,0:13:23.07,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}What? Is this something that can be changed easily?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:26.84,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}There'll be lots of problems once she attends elementary school.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.84,0:13:28.95,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,It's inevitable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.91,0:13:34.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well then, I will adopt Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.83,0:13:36.08,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.08,0:13:39.65,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,If she agrees to it, then she will really be Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.65,0:13:41.94,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's more natural this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.94,0:13:45.51,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,What do you mean?! Don't say something that important so carelessly.{Starting with "I'm telling you" is too clumsy.}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.51,0:13:46.72,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm not careless!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.72,0:13:48.52,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Anyway, it's something that has to be decided sooner or later.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.52,0:13:49.85,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So it doesn't matter when!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.85,0:13:51.13,Default,Dad,0000,0000,0000,,Now, now, now...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.13,0:13:52.35,Default,Mum,0000,0000,0000,,It's not the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.35,0:13:52.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It is!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.99,0:13:53.81,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Absolutely!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.91,0:13:58.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,In any case, I don't intend to hand her to anyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.76,0:14:01.73,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Also, these things should never have happened to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.35,0:14:08.91,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm willing to go all-out for her sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.61,0:14:12.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.15,0:14:14.44,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is this for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.44,0:14:15.83,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yes, it's for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.83,0:14:19.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,But you can only use it when I'm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:22.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I will let you use it if you can promise me that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.06,0:14:24.09,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.64,0:14:28.94,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll make some curry for you.{Added "some"-AE}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.94,0:14:30.48,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.48,0:14:31.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Today!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.93,0:14:33.99,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Let's make it tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.32,0:14:44.34,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Oh? Do I slice or cut?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.34,0:14:47.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Oh. Let me try.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.34,0:14:51.24,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.24,0:14:54.18,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi can really slice well.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.18,0:14:56.67,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Well, it's to be expected, since I've been living alone for so long.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.67,0:14:58.12,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come, you have a go too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.21,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Do it slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.15,0:15:13.05,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't drink the bath water.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.07,0:15:24.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Come, put your shoulders under and count to ten.{No one would say "submerge" to a little kid}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:32.61,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, saury mushrooms, burdock's six crocodile, seven, nine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.53,0:15:32.61,Default-Alt,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, three, four, five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.61,0:15:34.83,Default-Alt,,0000,0000,0000,,One, two, three, four, five, six...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.33,0:15:34.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, you're slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.22,0:15:41.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't rush yourself to eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.89,0:15:42.95,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.12,0:15:45.43,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.43,0:15:46.73,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.73,0:15:47.89,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.12,0:15:53.34,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin's curry is delicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.88,0:16:09.43,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Do I have to do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.43,0:16:12.44,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Ah, no. It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.97,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, {\alpha&HFFFF}I'm not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.97,0:16:18.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Hey, I'm not your father.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.98,0:16:20.24,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.24,0:16:22.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm also not your brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.56,0:16:25.84,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No one will think like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.84,0:16:27.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm just stating an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.15,0:16:29.00,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'm only asking what am I to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.78,0:16:31.17,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.17,0:16:33.17,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's my name.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.17,0:16:36.76,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Listen carefully, this has to be what you want.{reworded this sentence-AE}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.76,0:16:40.92,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Which means to say... how do I put it?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.92,0:16:43.26,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I'll be your...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.26,0:16:48.86,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Your real father, how's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.85,0:16:51.87,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi as my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.87,0:16:57.60,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, in that way, your name will be changed to Kawachi Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.60,0:17:00.20,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Kawachi... Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.66,0:17:04.66,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.38,0:17:06.57,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.57,0:17:08.88,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Isn't it better to have a father?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.88,0:17:11.36,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,My father is Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:14.21,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I am OK with my name as Kaga Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.21,0:17:17.30,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's important to have the same surname as Grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.81,0:17:21.25,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.31,0:17:24.31,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi can remain as Daikichi, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.28,0:17:30.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.91,0:17:32.02,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.02,0:17:33.19,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Are you crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.61,0:17:35.15,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,This is sweat!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.75,0:17:37.38,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's only March. {March is still winter, so it's impossible to sweat}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.38,0:17:39.53,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Shut up! Hurry and open your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.53,0:17:41.93,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I already opened wide; it's because you were crying.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.93,0:17:43.33,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I told you I wasn't crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.68,0:17:47.28,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Wider a bit.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.28,0:17:48.91,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.91,0:17:54.30,Default,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,From now on, this place shall be your home forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.30,0:17:55.83,Default,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,OK.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.45,0:18:10.06,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,You cannot forget trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.06,0:18:18.75,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Because daybreak will eventually come.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.75,0:18:28.04,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(0,960)}Our dreams; we must never lose sight of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.04,0:18:35.05,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(960,0)}They will eventually come true one day.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.05,0:18:43.49,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,The very first step, that first step towards tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.49,0:18:51.98,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,From today onwards, it will be an entirely new beginning.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.98,0:19:00.78,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,The very first step, that first step towards tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.78,0:19:09.62,Insert Song,Song,0000,0000,0000,,Draw your courage and take that very big first step.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.96,0:19:53.51,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.72,0:20:06.68,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,You'll get fat like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.68,0:20:08.57,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,Does it matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.57,0:20:10.54,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,I'm an imbecile, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.43,0:20:12.52,Default,Guy,0000,0000,0000,,Can I have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.52,0:20:13.98,Default,Masako,0000,0000,0000,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.13,0:22:00.24,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Only a baby needs someone to hug them. {Carry}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.24,0:22:01.85,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Sayaka-chan said before.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.85,0:22:02.86,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.86,0:22:04.31,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,How's that possible?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.31,0:22:07.22,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Even for adults, there are times when we want to be hugged by someone.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.22,0:22:10.07,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,But you're a grown-up, so why?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.07,0:22:12.14,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Well, I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.14,0:22:14.48,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Is it still OK if I'm a first grader?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.48,0:22:16.85,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Sure, why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.77,0:22:24.47,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,I can hug you anytime you want, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.00,0:22:30.13,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.13,0:22:33.74,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry, I should have given you a hug that time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.74,0:22:34.88,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.66,0:22:41.53,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,When Daikichi cries again next time, I will give him a hug.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.53,0:22:42.88,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Just exactly...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.55,0:22:47.23,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you worry!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.23,0:22:52.33,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,...am I the one looking after Rin, or is she looking after me?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.33,0:22:55.04,Default,PV,0000,0000,0000,,I'm starting to be unsure of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.11,OP Romaji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k5}{\k13}a{\k52}shi{\k45}ta {\k18}no {\k22}ko{\k25}to {\k21}ha {\k20}{\k20}wa{\k29}ka{\k17}n{\k9}na{\k6}i
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.11,OP Kanji,,0000,0000,0000,,{\k05}{\k29}明{\k81}日{\k18}の{\k22}こ{\k25}と{\k21}は{\k20}　{\k20}分{\k29}か{\k17}ん{\k9}な{\k6}い
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.99,0:00:56.11,OP English,,0000,0000,0000,,We don't know what's going to happen tomorrow.
